"char_end": 2982,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 844.86,
"end": 845.52,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2998,
"char_end": 3018,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 845.58,
"end": 852.54,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 3019,
"char_end": 3144,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 852.6,
"end": 854.94,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3145,
"char_end": 3207,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 855.0,
"end": 858.18,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3208,
"char_end": 3277,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 858.18,
"end": 859.74,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 3295,
"char_end": 3322,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 859.8,
"end": 862.74,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and have you since changed your mind?",
"char_start": 3323,
"char_end": 3404,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 862.74,
"end": 869.1,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Yes, so – a bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 3420,
