"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 869.16,
"end": 873.48,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3530,
"char_end": 3597,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 873.48,
"end": 874.5,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3615,
"char_end": 3637,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 874.56,
"end": 877.5,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you believe about this, and what have you since learned or reconsidered?",
"char_start": 3638,
"char_end": 3719,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 877.5,
"end": 878.16,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3735,
"char_end": 3755,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 878.22,
"end": 884.1,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3756,
"char_end": 3850,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 884.16,
"end": 886.5,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3851,
"char_end": 3906,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 886.56,
"end": 890.88,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3907,
"char_end": 3973,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 890.88,
"end": 892.38,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 3991,
"char_end": 4008,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 892.38,
"end": 901.8,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident. If you ignore that, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 4024,
"char_end": 4200,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 901.8,
"end": 902.82,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 4218,
"char_end": 4236,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 902.88,
"end": 907.2,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4237,
"char_end": 4314,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 907.2,
"end": 907.86,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 4330,
"char_end": 4350,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 907.92,
"end": 912.48,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 4351,
"char_end": 4427,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 912.54,
"end": 915.72,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4428,
"char_end": 4494,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
"end": 1323.96,
